---
import {QUOTE_IDENTITY,QUOTE_SCOPE} from '../../data/quote-fields';
---
<form id="quote-form" class="planner-form" data-save="hgg-quotes-v1">
<p class="help">Copy the written offers. Leave unknown prices blank. Use “Not applicable” only after confirming the item is unnecessary for the same target scope. For an excluded item, add its written incremental price. For an allowance, add only the expected top-up beyond the amount already included. Avoid double-counting bundled items.</p>
<div class="quote-grid">{['A','B','C'].map(letter=><fieldset class="quote-column" data-quote={letter}><legend>Quote {letter}</legend><label>Project total (USD)<input name={`${letter}-total`} type="number" min="0" max="1000000" step="0.01"/></label>
<details><summary>Equipment & terms</summary>{QUOTE_IDENTITY.map(([key,label])=><label>{label}<textarea name={`${letter}-${key}`} rows="2" maxlength="2000"/></label>)}</details>
<details><summary>Installation scope & adjustments</summary>{QUOTE_SCOPE.map(([key,label])=><div class="scope-row"><label>{label}<select name={`${letter}-${key}-status`}><option value="unknown">Unknown — clarify</option><option value="included">Included</option><option value="excluded">Excluded</option><option value="allowance">Allowance</option><option value="na">Not applicable — confirmed</option></select></label><label>Additional cost / top-up (USD)<input name={`${letter}-${key}-adjustment`} type="number" min="0" max="1000000" step="0.01"/></label></div>)}</details></fieldset>)}</div>
<button type="submit" disabled>Compare the three quotes</button><div class="form-error" role="alert"></div><div id="quote-results" class="planner-results" aria-live="polite"></div>
</form>
<div class="prose-hgg"><h2>Equal scope before lower price</h2><p>A normalization subtotal includes only the incremental amounts you supply. Unpriced exclusions, unresolved allowances and unknown scope remain open questions. Even a complete price table cannot validate the design, contractor qualifications, exclusions or warranty enforceability. It does not rank one installer as “best.”</p><p>Ask each installer to confirm the same fuel, backed-up loads, generator and transfer equipment, site work, permits, commissioning and service responsibilities. Save the dated offer and written clarifications. <a href="/cost/standby-generator-quote-checklist/">Use the full quote checklist</a>.</p></div>
